 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "On demand",
   "items": [
    "terraform apply -var preprod=true creates preprod-data + preprod-app; false destroys them, the elastic IP stays",
    "-var preprod_forum=true / preprod_replica=true add the optional VMs",
    "Same compositions and images as production (composition/v7), other variables and secrets",
    "All preprod VMs sit on their own VPC subnet and security group; only the bastion is in both the production and the preprod group"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Real data, guarded",
   "items": [
    "Database = production dump with third-party tokens and SSO keys removed (preprod-scrub.sql)",
    "No mail (no SMTP credentials); reCAPTCHA uses Google's test keys",
    "A v6_api PR preview (-e preprod_api_version=<tag>) runs against these data",
    "Writes never reach production: own buckets, own keys, forum off by default",
    "With the replica VM, preprod-data also archives its WAL (WAL-G) to c2corg-preprod-backups"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Borrowed from production",
   "items": [
    "forum.preprod: read-only proxy of the public forum; HTML pages redirect to it",
    "media: missing file → 302 to media.camptocamp.org (not for /c2corg-dem/)",
    "tracking: the production one, user ids of preprod tokens shifted by 1e9",
    "Tracker OAuth goes through the production return URL (UI relay)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Everyday",
   "items": [
    "deploy.yml --limit preprod: API, images, workers, UI (fast path)",
    "site.yml --limit preprod: everything else, and after each data load",
    "HAProxy follows recreated containers via Docker DNS, no restart"
   ]
  }
 ]
}